t (ADR-0049–0054)**\n- Authn: OAuth/OIDC login (GitHub/Forgejo/any issuer), PG sessions, Secure+HttpOnly+SameSite cookies, CSRF double-submit; scoped RBAC (Org⊃Project bindings, native-wins forge import, tombstoned revokes), run tenancy + cross-tenant denial.\n- Retention: leader-gated sweeper (logs 30d, artifacts 90d) + workspace-CAS mark-sweep GC with grace window — suspended runs untouchable by construction.\n- Multi-replica: claim-to-tail log lease, replica-agnostic live SSE from the durable index, unique replica identity.\n- Artifacts of record: `/scarab/artifacts` convention + globs, per-run store, list/download API, UI panel.\n- Observability/lifecycle: `/metrics`, JSON logs + request ids, `/readyz`, graceful SIGTERM drain, chart probe split + ServiceMonitor.\n- Product surface: run-cancel API with async Pod teardown (live-verified), OpenAPI full-route coverage + CI drift gate, web UI embedded same-origin in the server image, CLI `validate`/`lint`/`logs`/`restart` (no zero-exit stubs), dashboard fully de-mocked (real inbox/activity/repos/environments).\n\n- 408 tests green (17 live-gated `#[ignore]`), clippy clean, real Postgres throughout.\n- Live on Colima k3s: clone acceptance ×3, BuildKit build+push, results-egress e2e, cancel Pod teardown, artifacts harvest.\n- Also fixed en route: `git lfs pull -q` never worked; the outbox claim-expiry off-by-one-ms flake; all replicas sharing one lease identity.\n\n`docs/handoffs/dogfood-scarab-on-scarab.md` (last commit) — the dogfood plan: run this repo's own CI on Scarab with a real GitHub App + webhook tunnel, which exercises every remaining HUMAN VERIFY item.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","files":null}]}